# Do not 301 /mcat/ → /mcat. Netlify matches those paths as the same rule, so
# /mcat 301s to itself and the browser dies. The blank-page bug was relative
# app.js resolving as /mcat/app.js; index.html and loadScript now load from /.
# The catch-all below serves both /mcat and /mcat/ as the app.

# SPA fallback: serve the app for section deep-links (e.g. /medicine, /mcat) and
# for unknown paths, so the in-app not-found view can render. Must stay last —
